# Bake the agent's context window into the model itself.
#
# Why you'd want this: `num_ctx` is an Ollama parameter, and the OpenAI chat
# API has nowhere to put it. So when you reach the model through an
# OpenAI-compatible front door — OllaBridge, or anything else — you cannot set
# the window per request, and you get whatever default the model was built
# with (often far smaller than you want).
#
# Building your own tag fixes that everywhere at once: direct Ollama, through a
# gateway, from any SDK. The window travels with the model.
#
#   ollama create qwen3-agent -f Modelfile.example
#   ollama list                       # qwen3-agent appears
#
# Then point the tutorial at it:
#
#   DEEP_AGENT_MODEL=qwen3-agent
#
# 24576 is sized for a 12 GB card. Raise it if you have more VRAM, and re-run
# `make doctor` afterwards to confirm it still fits.

FROM qwen3:8b

PARAMETER num_ctx 24576
PARAMETER temperature 0
